# Prisma / MySQL (TiDB)

- `provider = "mysql"`. Connection from `DATABASE_URL` (TiDB; keep `sslaccept=strict`).
- Normalized models only: `User`, `Artist`, `Song`, `SongArtist`, `Rating`.
- Ratings: per-user 1–5 with `@@unique([userId, songId])`. No rating column on `Song`.
- Song↔Artist is M2M via join table - not CSV strings.
- Ship migrations + seed in-repo. Document average-rating rules in README/schema docs.
- Prefer Prisma Client over raw SQL; if raw SQL is required, keep it in one place and typed.
